[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 109 A good idea",
    "start": 0.69,
    "end": 4.992,
    "zh": "第109课 一个好主意",
    "zh_hant": "第109課 一個好主意"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.193,
    "end": 8.974,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 8.754,
    "end": 10.715,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What does Jane have with her coffee?",
    "start": 11.636,
    "end": 14.877,
    "zh": "简喝咖啡时搭配了什么？",
    "zh_hant": "簡喝咖啡時搭配了什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Shall I make some coffee, Jane?",
    "start": 17.019,
    "end": 20.62,
    "zh": "我来煮点咖啡好吗，简？",
    "zh_hant": "我來煮點咖啡好嗎，簡？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "That's a good idea, Charlotte.",
    "start": 21.541,
    "end": 25.162,
    "zh": "这是个好主意，夏洛特。",
    "zh_hant": "這是個好主意，夏洛特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "It's ready.",
    "start": 26.063,
    "end": 27.284,
    "zh": "煮好了。",
    "zh_hant": "煮好了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Do you want any milk?",
    "start": 27.964,
    "end": 30.325,
    "zh": "你要加点牛奶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你要加點牛奶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Just a little, please.",
    "start": 30.846,
    "end": 33.287,
    "zh": "只要一点点，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "只要一點點，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What about some sugar?",
    "start": 34.387,
    "end": 36.688,
    "zh": "来点糖怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "來點糖怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Two teaspoonfuls?",
    "start": 37.409,
    "end": 39.73,
    "zh": "两勺吗？",
    "zh_hant": "兩勺嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "No, less than that.",
    "start": 40.691,
    "end": 43.192,
    "zh": "不，少一点。",
    "zh_hant": "不，少一點。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "One and a half teaspoonfuls, please.",
    "start": 43.732,
    "end": 47.854,
    "zh": "一勺半，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "一勺半，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "That's enough for me.",
    "start": 48.194,
    "end": 50.055,
    "zh": "这对我来说够多了。",
    "zh_hant": "這對我來說夠多了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "That was very nice.",
    "start": 51.896,
    "end": 54.697,
    "zh": "那真的很好喝。",
    "zh_hant": "那真的很好喝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Would you like some more?",
    "start": 55.218,
    "end": 57.299,
    "zh": "你想再来一点吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你想再來一點嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Yes, please.",
    "start": 58.079,
    "end": 60.58,
    "zh": "好的，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "好的，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I'd like a cigarette, too.",
    "start": 61.501,
    "end": 64.422,
    "zh": "我还想抽根烟。",
    "zh_hant": "我還想抽根菸。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "May I have one?",
    "start": 64.843,
    "end": 66.723,
    "zh": "我可以拿一根吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我可以拿一根嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Of course.",
    "start": 67.484,
    "end": 69.065,
    "zh": "当然可以。",
    "zh_hant": "當然可以。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I think there are a few in that box.",
    "start": 69.605,
    "end": 73.587,
    "zh": "我想那个盒子里有几根。",
    "zh_hant": "我想那個盒子裡有幾根。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I'm afraid it's empty.",
    "start": 74.648,
    "end": 77.049,
    "zh": "恐怕是空的。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕是空的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "What a pity!",
    "start": 78.189,
    "end": 79.81,
    "zh": "真遗憾！",
    "zh_hant": "真遺憾！"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "It doesn't matter.",
    "start": 80.412,
    "end": 82.194,
    "zh": "没关系。",
    "zh_hant": "沒關係。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Have a biscuit instead.",
    "start": 83.176,
    "end": 85.719,
    "zh": "换个吃块饼干吧。",
    "zh_hant": "換個吃塊餅乾吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Eat more and smoke less!",
    "start": 86.221,
    "end": 89.625,
    "zh": "多吃点，少抽点！",
    "zh_hant": "多吃點，少抽點！"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "That's very good advice!",
    "start": 90.226,
    "end": 93.11,
    "zh": "那是很好的建议！",
    "zh_hant": "那是很好的建議！"
  }
]
